{"summary":"Movie Studio Management Simulation\nProduce blockbusters and earn world-wide fame","description":"Become the boss of film studios and lead them to world-wide fame, supervising production of blockbusters!\n\nCustomize your studios with facilities such as a CG or sound studio, staff cafeteria or acting school.\n\nHaving talented directors is key, but it's up to you to train them up, bring out their full potential, and offer them guidance when they get stuck.\n\nHire actors, or have famous pop icons, dancers, or comedians star in your films.\n\nHave fun with tons of possibilities picking the genre, themes, and filming location for your movies!\n\nProduce smash hits to win fans all over the world and break all box office records!\n\n-----\n・All game progress is stored on your device. Save data cannot be restored after deleting or reinstalling the app.\n\nTry searching for \"Kairosoft\" to see all of our games, or visit us at https://kairopark.jp/.\nBe sure to check out both our free-to-play and our paid games!\nKairosoft's pixel art game series continues!\nFollow us on Twitter for the latest Kairosoft news and information.\nhttps://twitter.com/kairokun2010","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MItIAzs6RSY?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4VTvKQBLtWezRvH0GoJb5LcpkORbVAp5HgbrRGZxYuOi7DGng4PPjnzhRzQDIXcQYqy2ABY_VGlJ0SETHcn-ww","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EPjdC43ZxMZCQbvh0qs4qL6Z_ShUwU7MdKD3LmMv1E0mStzEhzTD5Jn2Ui9lAfhiseWroeq4UjQDib9RaEFsPg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mBPL_-JKWAVOzR2xMdPA8TSjO3dzgEuq5A3-89JfwA5lZnBjkoUFvX8myOT_PXbR2Z9gdVDYHkeDjNCedJ5BCYI","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vq9pY9JDLtNt0ohXlOvaoNeYeE_aIeOT0RckWb32pU2HRjfhQsTpB9mfPzD4GX_Az77Q9rBxvfPuOgNN7Ygl2w","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dMBMFliwA0K0sLKNo2WXqhqObZD9nItbhoahMJrYYlsHv67OO7899vpAdLuwQ49niXcYrmGofbyynxo-3s4smA","https://play-lh